---
// Ill12TaxDecisionTree.astro
// Visual brief: The Full AIF Tax Decision Tree
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 12</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Full AIF Tax Decision Tree</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 rounded border border-indigo-500/20 font-medium">Multidimensional Map</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6 space-y-6">
    <!-- Level 1: Category -->
    <div>
      <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block mb-2">Step 1: Regulatory Classification</span>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700/60 text-center">
          <div class="font-bold text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">Category I</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mt-1 font-mono">Sec 224 Pass-Through</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700/60 text-center">
          <div class="font-bold text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">Category II</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mt-1 font-mono">Sec 224 Pass-Through</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 text-center">
          <div class="font-bold text-xs text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">Category III</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 mt-1 font-mono">No Sec 224 Pass-Through</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Level 2: Legal Form for Cat III -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
      <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block mb-2">Step 2: Category III Structure & Form</span>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white block">Contributory Trust</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Representative Assessee / MMR if indeterminate</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white block">Corporate (Pvt Ltd)</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">22% / 25% Corporate Tax + Dividend Tax</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white block">LLP Vehicle</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">30% Flat Tax + Profit share exempt</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Level 3: Income Character & Location -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1">Step 3: Income Character</span>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-mono">LTCG (12.5%)</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-mono">STCG (20%)</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/40 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 font-mono font-bold">Business (MMR 39%+)</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-mono">Dividend/Interest</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1">Step 4: Special Jurisdiction</span>
        <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded bg-teal-50 dark:bg-teal-950/30 border border-teal-200 dark:border-teal-800/40">
          <span class="font-bold text-teal-800 dark:text-teal-300">GIFT IFSC Specified Fund</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Exemptions Apply</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">There is no single “AIF tax rate.” The answer is assembled from several legal and structural dimensions.</p>
  </div>
</div>
